PROGRAM packing receipt

RECORD Parcel
  label: text
  quantity: integer

REQUEST print receipt
  GIVEN parcel is Parcel
  WHEN issue receipt for parcel

WHEN issue receipt for <parcel>
  GIVEN parcel is Parcel
  REQUIRE parcel.quantity > 0
  print "Packing receipt"
  print parcel
  print parcel.quantity

SCENARIO receipt preserves its label and exact quantity
GIVEN parcel is Parcel
  label: "fragile # café"
  quantity: 9007199254740993

REQUEST print receipt

THEN prints ["Packing receipt", {"label": "fragile # café", "quantity": 9007199254740993}, 9007199254740993]
AND parcel.quantity == 9007199254740993

SCENARIO empty output is explicit
WHEN PASS

THEN prints []
